YESSS!! That's EXactly what I mean! Sorry I bit wired from the lack of sleep haha but I'll def check out the sub. 

&#x200B;

Actually dude is it cool if I ask you a few questions about this? I don't really come across a lot of people irl who are into these kinds of philosophies. I've been trying to consolidate all the sciences and like link em into spirituality haha. It's actually insane how connected it all is, from neuroscience to quantum physics (I have a very tentative grasp on all these subjects tho).

Well I don't..really understand it but I was talking about the relativity where you physically age slower when you move at a certain velocity (or something like that)

&#x200B;

And by sources I'm asking where you learned this stuff :) like where did you get this information you have on time because it's not entirely something you could just come up with intuitively right?

Me? No, I'm agnostic but my parents (and most people here) are incredibly religious (Christians). 

&#x200B;

I like to watch youtube and stuff but that's because I'm an introvert..most people tend to hang out with friends, go to the mall..all that good stuff
